==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.13~1 seconds<sup>4f~30f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.27~1.33 seconds<sup>8f~40f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.27~1.33 seconds<sup>8f~40f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 13.33~60 seconds<sup>400f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 60~80 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Beefcake Cat (Enemy)|Beefcake Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**4 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**6 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
**6 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 4~13.33 seconds<sup>120f~400f</sup>.
**10 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 0.07~1.33 seconds<sup>2f~40f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage features many aggressive pushers, like Angelic Gory. For this reason, tanky meatshields like [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] and fast meatshields like [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] will be extremely important. Your main attackers will need to be able to deal with the rush of Angelic Gories at base hit. Units with Long Distance or Wave Attacks can pierce through the front lines, hopefully killing Owlbrow, giving you cash. As long as you can survive the steady stream of peons and chip Beefcake, you'll win eventually.

